meta {
  name: Chat - File a complaint as Customer (stream)
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/chat
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  x-customer-id: 3
}

body:json {
  {
    "conversation_id": "8b2f6d14-7c3a-4e95-a1d0-4f9e3b7c2a58",
    "message": "O pedido 1 chegou com a caixa amassada e quero reclamar. O que posso fazer?"
  }
}

docs {
  The Assistant summarizes the Complaint and asks for confirmation before filing. Then send a second
  message in the same conversation_id (e.g. "Sim, pode registrar") if it asks. It then replies with
  "Protocolo #N" and the 24-business-hour promise. As a Visitor (drop x-customer-id) it sends you to
  the store's WhatsApp and e-mail instead.
}
